        `top of the reduced-rate 14% band` IS 120_720   -- (b)(1)(b)
        `top of the reduced-rate 20% band` IS 228_000   -- (b)(1)(c)
        `top of the reduced-rate 31% band` IS 301_200   -- (b)(1)(d)

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 121, note at source line 4350; s 120B(e)(1) (source line 4344)
